---
import Case from "../Case.astro"
import Testimonial from "../Testimonial.astro"
import screenshot from "../../images/hogeschool-utrecht.png"
---

<Case
  title="Hogeschool Utrecht"
  url="https://pathfinder.stef.co"
  image={screenshot}
>
  <div class="summary">
    <p>
      I made a Progressive Web App for Hogeschool Utrecht with React. It's a
      tool that lets you select strategies for behaviour change.
    </p>
    <p>
      The app was initially built as a prototype, but main functionality was
      achieved within budget so I cleaned it up and added extra features (PWA,
      responsive breakpoints). The design was done by{" "}
      <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.panton.nl">
        Panton
      </a>
      .
    </p>
  </div>
  <Testimonial
    author="Dr. Sander Hermsen"
    jobTitle="Senior Researcher Design & Behaviour Change"
    company="Hogeschool Utrecht"
    companyURL="https://www.onderzoek.hu.nl/Onderzoekers/Sander-Hermsen"
  >
    <p>
      "Stef is a creative and reliable partner who delivers good products. He
      works quickly and is affordable. Moreover, he is very pleasant in
      communication and is proactive. In our project for Hogeschool Utrecht, he
      knew how to handle the production process so well, that more could be
      achieved than initially budgeted - not exactly common in IT land. Highly
      recommended!"
    </p>
  </Testimonial>
</Case>
